{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1722870/extras/602e984ddae26c846ae74288d10013b0.poster.avif?t=1769809260\" width=1170 height=436 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1722870/extras/602e984ddae26c846ae74288d10013b0.webm?t=1769809260\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1722870/extras/602e984ddae26c846ae74288d10013b0.mp4?t=1769809260\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1722870/extras/ccb9ca56bdf462603ffa6639115d2fe5.avif?t=1769809260\" width=600 height=70 /></span><i>Clank!</i>, the iconic deck-building board game adventure, challenges daring thieves to sneak into a dragon\u2019s lair, steal one of her precious artifacts, and escape \u2013 before you\u2019re roasted to a crisp!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Winning fans and awards around the world, <i>Clank!</i> is one of the most-beloved modern board games, with a wide range of expansions and adaptations for players to enjoy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1722870/extras/c9e394e04b92d427fb10b40dc85873ce.avif?t=1769809260\" width=600 height=70 /></span>The deeper you go, the more valuable treasures you\u2019ll find\u2026but the harder it will be to escape! So be quick and be quiet: One false step and \u2013 <i>CLANK!</i> Each careless sound risks drawing the dragon\u2019s attention.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re competing against your fellow thieves to claim the most valuable prize\u2026but you can only enjoy your loot if you make it out of the depths alive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1722870/extras/1275ac5f06dafc1eb947df8a80428a13.avif?t=1769809260\" width=600 height=70 /></span>You\u2019ll need a good pair of boots, a sharp sword, and all your roguish skills to survive in the dungeon. Along the way, you\u2019ll acquire new items, abilities, and allies that will help you achieve victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blending deck-building and exploration, <i>Clank!</i> offers a unique dungeon-delving adventure each time you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1722870/extras/f96bd21c05066de2c78ccbf52a378695.avif?t=1769809260\" width=600 height=70 /></span>Learn the ropes in a guided Tutorial, then hone your abilities by collecting Achievements and completing Challenges. Play cross-platform against friends, or compete in exciting new Heists that put you up against players from around the world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However you choose to enter the dungeon: Good luck!...you\u2019re going to need it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1722870/extras/02fac9bf7b56300fb8dc81059b14337a.poster.avif?t=1769809260\" width=1170 height=436 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1722870/extras/02fac9bf7b56300fb8dc81059b14337a.webm?t=1769809260\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1722870/extras/02fac9bf7b56300fb8dc81059b14337a.mp4?t=1769809260\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Fledgling Thief","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1722870/6896d221c99057e49275b05d5ea0c0f74e9d0219.jpg"},{"name":"Socialite","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1722870/09986a377da1cec28c041f13fb82c0a82ff2af36.jpg"},{"name":"First Score","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1722870/9daee1638271fc4b8a365b96e49d089cd516999d.jpg"},{"name":"Infamous Thief","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1722870/41ffd4c139392f484ff9ddeabddf72221eb54b6f.jpg"},{"name":"Burgling Empire","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1722870/ba94b44c95cccd4e7097380bbf7dc5acd6f64eb7.jpg"},{"name":"Status Symbol","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1722870/3aa7d487e6c888b61894c6adeb2888ae7bcb83dc.jpg"},{"name":"Royal Friends","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1722870/7a1d1d96bd4ef4208cc51f9a972c7f9597a41c38.jpg"},{"name":"Close Call","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1722870/23676924cc03eb596e1e1562eac0ded58ecf668c.jpg"},{"name":"Just A Scratch","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1722870/cbbbdfddb4d1498a5d85ed3233f673d0e42d3496.jpg"},{"name":"Risk-Loving","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1722870/a55009341a637de9af69d876291efb59e7aafb55.jpg"}],"total":32},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1722870?t=1769809260","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1722870/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769809260","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steam