9re roasted to a crisp!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Winning fans and awards around the world, <i>Clank!</i> is one of the most-beloved modern board games, with a wide range of expansions and adaptations for players to enjoy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1722870/extras/c9e394e04b92d427fb10b40dc85873ce.avif?t=1769809260\" width=600 height=70 /></span>The deeper you go, the more valuable treasures you\u2019ll find\u2026but the harder it will be to escape! So be quick and be quiet: One false step and \u2013 <i>CLANK!</i> Each careless sound risks drawing the dragon\u2019s attention.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re competing against your fellow thieves to claim the most valuable prize\u2026but you can only enjoy your loot if you make it out of the depths alive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1722870/extras/1275ac5f06dafc1eb947df8a80428a13.avif?t=1769809260\" width=600 height=70 /></span>You\u2019ll need a good pair of boots, a sharp sword, and all your roguish skills to survive in the dungeon. Along the way, you\u2019ll acquire new items, abilities, and allies that will help you achieve victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blending deck-building and exploration, <i>Clank!</i> offers a unique dungeon-delving adventure each time you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1722870/extras/f96bd21c05066de2c78ccbf52a378695.avif?t=1769809260\" width=600 height=70 /></span>Learn the ropes in a guided Tutorial, then hone your abilities by collecting Achievements and completing Challenges. Play cross-platform against friends, or compete in exciting new Heists that put you up against players from around the world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However you choose to enter the dungeon: Good luck!...you\u2019re going to need it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1722870/extras/02fac9bf7b56300fb8dc81059b14337a.poster.avif?t=1769809260\" width=1170 height=436 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1722870/extras/02fac9bf7b56300fb8dc81059b14337a.webm?t=1769809260\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1722870/extras/02fac9bf7b56300fb8dc81059b14337a.mp4?t=1769809260\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Dire Wolf"],"dlc":[3550040],"ext_user_account_notice":"Dire Wolf Account ","genres":[{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1722870/ed76a3e3ba468f4f7c3dd8d49b36f905534660c9/header_alt_assets_1.jpg?t=1769809260","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2016-2026 Dire Wolf Digital, Inc. All Rights Reserved.<br />\r\nClank! and Clank! In! Space! are trademarks of Dire Wolf Digital, Inc","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.15<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce 8600M GT (256 MB) or ATI Rad